---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { image } from '../../lib/images';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Interior Design & Remodelling — Carpenter Meghann B"
  description="Complete interior renovations from kitchen remodels to full home transformations. Red Seal Carpenter Meghann Barsalou, Prince Rupert, BC."
>
  <section class="service-hero">
    <Picture
      src={image('portfolio/kitchen/kitchen2.jpg')}
      widths={[768, 1280, 1920]}
      sizes="100vw"
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="service-hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-center">Carpentry Services</p>
      <h1>Interior Design &amp; Remodelling</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="service-content">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/services">All services</a></p>
      <h2>Transform Your Interior Spaces</h2>
      <p>Your home should reflect your lifestyle and personality. Whether you're dreaming of a modern kitchen, a refreshed bathroom, or a complete interior transformation, I bring both technical skill and design sensibility to every remodelling project.</p>
      <p>As a carpenter who personally selects materials, I let the natural qualities of wood, stone, and other materials guide the creative process. The result is a space that feels both intentional and alive.</p>

      <h2>What I Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Kitchen remodelling and cabinet installation</li>
        <li>Bathroom renovations</li>
        <li>Custom built-ins and shelving</li>
        <li>Flooring installation</li>
        <li>Trim, moulding, and finishing work</li>
        <li>Drywall repair and installation</li>
        <li>Painting and finishing</li>
        <li>Full home renovations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>My Approach</h2>
      <p>I believe that interior remodelling should be a collaborative process. I work closely with you to understand how you use your space, what you love about it, and what you'd like to change. From there, I develop a plan that balances aesthetics, functionality, and budget.</p>
      <p>Throughout the project, I maintain open communication and a clean work environment. I treat your home with respect, and I'm committed to delivering results that exceed your expectations.</p>

      <div style="margin-top: var(--space-fluid-xl); text-align: center;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
